{"name": "Loftia", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loftia is a cozy multiplayer game about building a life in the sky. Set across floating islands, you\u2019ll farm, craft, decorate, and explore alongside friends in a shared world that grows over time. Whether you\u2019re hanging out after a long day or teaming up for a bigger adventure, Loftia is a place to slow down, connect, and create something meaningful together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In the world of Loftia, you can:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"92\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/fd276cebdb6fd6c97763a1ce102add32.avif?t=1792418092\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"678\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/4b0153837a5e1b830e589e2aac3aee49.poster.avif?t=1792418092\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/4b0153837a5e1b830e589e2aac3aee49.webm?t=1792418092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/4b0153837a5e1b830e589e2aac3aee49.mp4?t=1792418092\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the world of Loftia, meet and befriend NPCs, tackle quests to help the community, and gather and craft with resources and tools to help you on your journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"179\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/2d3511f03b40d43497b5e4f8b702001f.avif?t=1792418092\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/a149c3217e410978e1f0aa0315765f80.poster.avif?t=1792418092\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/a149c3217e410978e1f0aa0315765f80.webm?t=1792418092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/a149c3217e410978e1f0aa0315765f80.mp4?t=1792418092\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master sustainable farming techniques like hydroponics, aquaponics, and trellis farming. Craft your own tools using renewable energy generated from the sun, wind and rain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"179\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/31c53a0364e7f21824efda31c5179edc.avif?t=1792418092\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/eb354b0d24c65d75434aa4ff79ae70c6.poster.avif?t=1792418092\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/eb354b0d24c65d75434aa4ff79ae70c6.webm?t=1792418092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/eb354b0d24c65d75434aa4ff79ae70c6.mp4?t=1792418092\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create a character that feels fully like you, and design your home in the style you love. There's a super wide variety of different options and aesthetics for you to choose from!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/60a7643d6b4bdcb786535a43783b245c.poster.avif?t=1792418092\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/60a7643d6b4bdcb786535a43783b245c.webm?t=1792418092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/60a7643d6b4bdcb786535a43783b245c.mp4?t=1792418092\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"92\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/d8bc9fd4d5b923af0d317c27b01e1964.avif?t=1792418092\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/bbd72c2937424d016bd12714cc573210.poster.avif?t=1792418092\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/bbd72c2937424d016bd12714cc573210.webm?t=1792418092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/bbd72c2937424d016bd12714cc573210.mp4?t=1792418092\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>  Create your own floating island and link up with others to form neighborhoods. Decorate, farm, craft, and spend time together in shared spaces that feel lived-in and personal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"179\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/d44a80f17f4561154640aa7fa646189b.avif?t=1792418092\" width=\"1560\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/cf48514ded7d8db34cb4cef4a3d0f0c5.poster.avif?t=1792418092\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/cf48514ded7d8db34cb4cef4a3d0f0c5.webm?t=1792418092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/cf48514ded7d8db34cb4cef4a3d0f0c5.mp4?t=1792418092\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rescue and adopt animals to join you on your journey, from capybaras and turtles to other unique species. Bring them along, dress them up, and let them keep you company as you explore the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"179\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/3286396371fd4ccfdae6f3dc126270fd.avif?t=1792418092\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/679e5950193d4363b9bff6b4800f616a.poster.avif?t=1792418092\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/679e5950193d4363b9bff6b4800f616a.webm?t=1792418092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/679e5950193d4363b9bff6b4800f616a.mp4?t=1792418092\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture beyond the city to scavenge in abandoned factories, solve puzzles, and take on group quests across different biomes. Team up when you want, or explore at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"179\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/e9bbeb5daccd2cb5831678a351d70241.avif?t=1792418092\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"678\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/c7912b7d82a04bbb3afc8ec34ca3d585.poster.avif?t=1792418092\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/c7912b7d82a04bbb3afc8ec34ca3d585.webm?t=1792418092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/c7912b7d82a04bbb3afc8ec34ca3d585.mp4?t=1792418092\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work together on community projects that help the world grow. By contributing to shared builds, you\u2019ll unlock new resources, uncover hidden stories, and open up new islands to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Welcome to Loftia, a cozy, multiplayer world where you can build towards a brighter, more sustainable future! Connect with friends both old and new, to farm, craft, explore, decorate, and create a meaningful impact - together.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steam